.* ASSIST: the task menu for the operational assistant.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 2'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPTION CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=PANELID CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='ASSIST'.
:KEYL NAME=MENUKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.F1=Help
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION='CMD CALL QCMD'.F9=Command line
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=ASSIST HELP=HLPASSIST KEYL=MENUKEYS ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM PANELID=PANELID.Operational Assistant (TM) Menu
:MENU DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES OPTIONS=OPTION.To select one of the following, type its number below and press Enter:
:MENUI OPTION=1 ACTION='CMD WRKSPLF'.Work with printer output
:MENUI OPTION=2 ACTION='CMD WRKUSRJOB'.Work with jobs
:MENUI OPTION=3 ACTION='CMD WRKMSG'.Work with messages
:MENUI OPTION=4 ACTION='CMD ?SNDMSG'.Send messages
:MENUI OPTION=5 ACTION='CMD CHGPWD'.Change your password
:MENUI OPTION=10 ACTION='MENU MANAGESYS'.Manage your system, users, and devices
:MENUI OPTION=11 ACTION='MENU SETUP'.Customize your system, users, and devices
:MENUI OPTION=75 ACTION='MENU USERHELP'.Information and problem handling
:MENUI OPTION=80 ACTION='CMD SIGNOFF'.Temporary sign-off
:EMENU.
:BOTINST.Type a menu option below
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPASSIST.Operational Assistant (TM) Menu - Help
:P.A short list of the tasks most users need, without a command line. F9
opens one when a command is wanted.
:P.Type an option number and press Enter. F9 opens a command line, F3
leaves the menu and F12 returns to the one before it.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
